{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367520/extras/34bcd69cbf9e4c44faa87f24e2b6971f.avif?t=1770803881\" width=1560 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your way through a solar system on the brink of disaster and drive out the invading forces of the Remnants in this intense action-packed space combat roguelike!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367520/extras/7ed2c9d7d9d3e5820edaa15ee57a0cfb.poster.avif?t=1770803881\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367520/extras/7ed2c9d7d9d3e5820edaa15ee57a0cfb.webm?t=1770803881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367520/extras/7ed2c9d7d9d3e5820edaa15ee57a0cfb.mp4?t=1770803881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367520/extras/a7de3a84680d1c09a87746dcd9d18022.avif?t=1770803881\" width=1560 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Remnants launched a full-scale invasion on Union territory and have taken over the Solar Transportation Network. But without knowledge of the complex technology, a devastating calamity looms, and the access points to the network threaten to rip everything apart in a disastrous singularity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the  pilot of a spaceship with groundbreaking propulsion technology, now spearheading the counter-strike against Remnant forces across various planet hubs. You are joined by your onboard companion, <strong>Merlin</strong>, who automatically supports you with various active and passive skills throughout your encounters. Now it's up to you to secure the transportation network. Drive out the Remnants and ensure <strong><u>RETRIBUTION</u></strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367520/extras/2b4a033eda319deb4af1af81137920b3.poster.avif?t=1770803881\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367520/extras/2b4a033eda319deb4af1af81137920b3.webm?t=1770803881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367520/extras/2b4a033eda319deb4af1af81137920b3.mp4?t=1770803881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367520/extras/3c99fd52e4d06452e31b7c2bcba95294.avif?t=1770803881\" width=1560 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6 <strong>Intense 3D Space Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master thrilling dogfights and battles against powerful warships with speed, precision, and tactical control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6 <strong>Roguelike</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in procedurally generated missions that last 5\u20137 minutes, offering high replayability with each run. Use a mixture of temporary modules and permanent upgrades to improve your chances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6 <strong>Onboard companion</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ship\u2019s AI, Merlin, automatically supports you in combat, executing abilities and assisting in strategic maneuvers. Upgrade Merlin\u2019s skills to create powerful synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6 <strong>Customizable Builds</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn rewards to upgrade weapons, ship modules, and AI abilities. Experiment with specialized skills like friend-or-foe disruption or improved dash abilities. Install powerful permanent upgrades that persist across runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6 <strong>High-stakes battles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in battles in hubs like Mars or Jupiter to prevent the catastrophic collapse of the Solar Transportation Network.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6 <strong>Permadeath pressure</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repair and upgrade your ship between missions to survive. One mistake could spell the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367520/extras/643e09058ade1cd40567c58b980cccbd.poster.avif?t=1770803881\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367520/extras/643e09058ade1cd40567c58b980cccbd.webm?t=1770803881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367520/extras/643e09058ade1cd40567c58b980cccbd.mp4?t=1770803881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3367520?t=1770803881","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3367520?t=1770803881","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367520/a6bd1ce2c7dbbd75bce3d52aa23da55dcf2b3675/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770803881","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367520/a6bd1ce2c7dbbd75bce3d52aa23da55dcf2b3675/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770803881","cat